          "pose": "sit"
        }
      ],
      "on_screen_text": "King at 20. Never beaten.",
      "narration": "Quick summary. He became king at twenty. By thirty, he ruled most of the known world. And he never lost a major battle.",
      "word_count": 23
    },
    {
      "id": "intro-3",
      "speaker": "son",
      "section": "Intro",
      "start": 22,
