      "background": "tyresea",
      "camera": "slow pan left",
      "characters": [],
      "on_screen_text": "The fire ship",
      "narration": "The Tyrians struck back. They took a big cargo ship, packed it with dry branches, pitch and sulfur, and towed it toward the causeway. Then they set it on fire and let the wind carry it in.",
      "word_count": 37
    },
    {
      "id": "shot-13",
      "speaker": null,
      "sfx": [
        {
          "type": "boom",
          "at": 0
        },
        {
