      "background": "tyresea",
      "camera": "slow pan right",
      "characters": [],
      "on_screen_text": null,
      "narration": "And as if that wasn't enough, a storm swept in and washed away a big part of months of work.",
      "word_count": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "shot-15",
      "speaker": null,
      "section": "Start again, bigger",
      "start": 355,
      "duration": 10,
      "image": "images/shot-15.png",
      "background": "tyresea",
      "camera": "slow zoom in",
      "characters": [
        {
          "name": "Alexander",
          "expression": "determined",
          "pose": "stand"
        }
      ],
      "on_screen_text": null,
      "narration": "Most generals would have packed up and gone home. To Alexander, it only meant one thing: the causeway hadn't been wide enough.",
      "word_count": 22
    },
    {
      "id": "shot-16",
      "speaker": null,
      "section": "Start again, bigger",
      "start": 365,
      "duration": 10,
      "image": "images/shot-16.png",
      "background": "tyresea",
      "camera": "slow pan right",
      "characters": [
        {
          "name": "Alexander",
          "expression": "smug",
          "pose": "stand"
        }
      ],
      "on_screen_text": "Wider. Stronger.",
      "narration": "He started over, building a new and much wider causeway. And he fixed his biggest weakness. He went and got himself a navy.",
      "word_count": 23
    },
    {
      "id": "lebanon",
      "speaker": null,
      "section": "Start again, bigger",
      "start": 375,
      "duration": 17,
      "image": "images/lebanon.png",
      "background": "valley",
      "camera": "slow pan right",
      "characters": [],
      "on_screen_text": "Lebanon mountains",
      "narration": "And he didn't sit still while he waited. Hill tribes in the Lebanon mountains kept attacking his timber cutters, so Alexander took a small force up into the mountains himself, dealt with them, and was back in about ten days.",
      "word_count": 40
    },
    {
      "id": "shot-17",
      "speaker": null,
      "section": "Start again, bigger",
      "start": 392,
      "duration": 13,
      "image": "images/shot-17.png",
      "background": "tyresea",
      "camera": "slow zoom in",
      "characters": [],
      "on_screen_text": "About 200 warships",
      "narration": "Cities he had already taken, like Sidon and Byblos, sent their warships. The kings of Cyprus brought over a hundred more. Now Tyre was the one surrounded, by sea.",
      "word_count": 29
    },
    {
      "id": "talk-ships-1",
      "speaker": "son",
      "section": "Start again, bigger",
      "start": 405,
      "duration": 5,
      "image": "images/talk-ships-1.png",
      "background": "tyresea",
      "camera": "static",
      "characters": [
        {
          "name": "Father",
