        },
        {
          "name": "Son",
          "expression": "surprised",
          "pose": "stand"
        }
      ],
      "on_screen_text": null,
      "narration": "So he built a whole navy just to finish his road?",
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "id": "talk-ships-2",
      "speaker": "father",
      "section": "Start again, bigger",
      "start": 410,
      "duration": 15,
      "image": "images/talk-ships-2.png",
      "background": "tyresea",
      "camera": "slow zoom in",
      "characters": [
        {
          "name": "Father",
          "expression": "determined",
          "pose": "stand"
        },
        {
          "name": "Son",
          "expression": "neutral",
          "pose": "stand"
        }
      ],
      "on_screen_text": null,
      "narration": "Pretty much. Here's what made Alexander so dangerous: he treated a failure as information, not as the end. The fire ship taught him he needed control of the water. So he went and got it.",
      "word_count": 35
    },
    {
      "id": "shot-18",
      "speaker": null,
      "section": "Start again, bigger",
      "start": 425,
      "duration": 16,
      "image": "images/shot-18.png",
