      "image": "images/shot-24.png",
      "background": "tyremap",
      "camera": "slow zoom in",
      "characters": [],
      "on_screen_text": "Tyre today",
      "narration": "Over the centuries, sand carried along the coast piled up against it, wider and wider. Today, Tyre isn't an island anymore. It's joined to the coast of Lebanon by a strip of land, and geologists who drilled into it found Alexander's road still buried inside.",
      "word_count": 45
    },
    {
      "id": "shot-25",
      "speaker": null,
      "section": "A new map",
      "start": 608,
      "duration": 7,
      "image": "images/shot-25.png",
      "background": "tyresea",
      "camera": "quick push in",
      "characters": [
        {
          "name": "Alexander",
          "expression": "smug",
          "pose": "stand"
        }
      ],
      "on_screen_text": null,
      "narration": "All because Alexander didn't like taking detours. He changed the map of the world.",
      "word_count": 14
    },
    {
      "id": "talk-lesson-1",
      "speaker": "son",
      "section": "A new map",
      "start": 615,
      "duration": 4,
      "image": "images/talk-lesson-1.png",
      "background": "tyresea",
      "camera": "static",
      "characters": [
        {
          "name": "Father",
          "expression": "neutral",
          "pose": "stand"
        },
        {
          "name": "Son",
          "expression": "determined",
          "pose": "stand"
        }
      ],
      "on_screen_text": null,
      "narration": "Okay, so what actually made him that good?",
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "id": "talk-lesson-2",
      "speaker": "father",
      "section": "A new map",
      "start": 619,
      "duration": 18,
      "image": "images/talk-lesson-2.png",
      "background": "tyresea",
      "camera": "slow zoom in",
      "characters": [
        {
          "name": "Father",
          "expression": "smug",
          "pose": "stand"
        },
        {
          "name": "Son",
          "expression": "neutral",
          "pose": "stand"
        }
      ],
      "on_screen_text": null,
      "narration": "Three things. He saw the big picture: why Tyre mattered when others saw just a stubborn island. He answered every setback with a new idea. And when a chance appeared, he took it instantly. Vision, imagination and speed, all in one person.",
      "word_count": 42
    },
