        }
      ],
      "on_screen_text": "Next: the empty fort",
      "narration": "Japan's coming, I promise. But next time: a general who won without fighting at all. Legend says he opened his city gates, sat on the wall, and played music, and an army of a hundred and fifty thousand turned around and left.",
